@baseUrl = http://localhost:5266

### Step 1 — Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credential": "tclaiborne",
  "password": "Password1!"
}

###

### Step 2 — GET portfolio → triggers snapshot creation for today
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/portfolio
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

###

### Step 3 — GET snapshot history → should include today's snapshot
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/portfolio/snapshots
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

###

### Step 4 — GET portfolio again → snapshot already exists, no duplicate created
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/portfolio
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

###

### Step 5 — GET snapshots again → count should be same as step 3 (idempotent)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/portfolio/snapshots
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

###

### Step 6 — Hit snapshots without token → expect 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/portfolio/snapshots